  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>This rune evokes the might of those who survive in the wintry wilds, such as frost giants. While wearing or carrying an object inscribed with it, you have Advantage on Wisdom (Animal Handling) and Charisma (Intimidation) checks. In addition, you can invoke the rune as a Bonus Action to increase your sturdiness: for 10 minutes, you gain a +2 bonus to all ability checks and saving throws that use Strength or Constitution.</p><p>Once you invoke this rune, you can't do so again until you finish a Short or Long Rest (twice per rest with Master of Runes). If the rune requires a saving throw, your Rune Magic save DC equals 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
